# UI & PWA

## Layout

- Driver shell: `src/app/(app)/layout.tsx` — fixed bottom nav (Loads, Damage, Search, Export), `pb-20` for content.
- Content width: `mx-auto w-full max-w-lg` (auth: `max-w-md`).
- Styling: Tailwind v4 utility classes; theme tokens in `globals.css` (`@theme inline`). Fonts: Geist via CSS variables from root layout.
- Prefer large tap targets; portrait / standalone PWA (`manifest.ts`).

## Components

Colocate by domain under `src/components/{auth,camera,damage,export,loads,pwa}/`. Re-export Serwist provider from `pwa/serwist-provider.tsx` (do not import `@serwist/turbopack/react` ad hoc elsewhere).

## Service worker

- Edit `src/app/sw.ts` carefully; keep offline document fallback to `/~offline`.
- Root layout wraps children with `<SerwistProvider swUrl="/serwist/sw.js">`.
- Middleware must continue excluding `/serwist/` and static icon assets.

## Product copy

App name is **PrivateFleet** (metadata / manifest). Keep UI copy driver-oriented (loads, trailers, damage, noticed).
